3642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341900/extras/09e0ab44a31c94367272029e658abc73.webm?t=1732093642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341900/extras/09e0ab44a31c94367272029e658abc73.mp4?t=1732093642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A nutty sidekick joins the mix</h2>Player 2 can control George's sidekick: Swirlz the flying squirrel! Create helpful springy flowers, blast enemies with magic, or become a living parachute to slow George's descent. When George and Swirlz work together, nothing is impossible!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341900/extras/481d8501c3ef499b2a1d2a674551f686.poster.avif?t=1732093642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341900/extras/481d8501c3ef499b2a1d2a674551f686.webm?t=1732093642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1341900/extras/481d8501c3ef499b2a1d2a674551f686.mp4?t=1732093642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "A hand-drawn, retro 3D collectathon. Parkour through a magic castle as George the Giraffe! String together sweet moves to explore crystal caverns, stone laden halls, and trippy alternate dimensions.",
