    "reviews": "\u201cReally makes you FEEL like a parkouring giraffe.\u201d<br>100/10 \u2013 Peter Lantz, Developer<br><br>\u201cIf 3D platformers are your bag, this game is a must-play.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 PC Invasion<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s clear Castle on the Coast was made with love; the small development team has put their heart and soul into this project, resulting in something fun and imaginative.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Games Asylum<br>",
